n use profits from the game store  to develop new games  the experience they get from building  fortnite informs how they think about  the next version of unreal engine and so  on  it's a virtuous cycle that helps keep  the company growing indefinitely and  that's awesome  if you want to chat about startups just  leave me a comment below or dm me on  twitter  and please check out this recommended  video the youtube algorithm thinks that  you'll really like it
 

